Z||000001||Tigger||12-14-2001||11:01 AM||||Yes, fastbacks are exclusively GT's.  However I do know '85 GT's were notchbacks with the aero ground effects.  Then from 86-88 all GT's were fastbacks.<P>It is possible to convert a notchback into a fastback so you may run across a few that have been converted.  Rare to ever see a fastback converted to a notchback.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 12-14-2001).]||||reg||1
